    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962010/extras/e6521ff59a18014e1c60b0b4fa5e4806.avif?t=1752506110\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame It Too! is a survival harem breeding game! Here you'll find everything you love about these genres. Every day will be a challenge, because survival is not just for show! You'll have to take care of yourself and your girlfriends, evolve, adapt to the local flora and fauna, conquer, build, learn and teach!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962010/extras/79e197d30ddeb84592b9c43543932e2b.avif?t=1752506110\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After crash-landing on a new, even more dangerous island, Lee\u2019s adventure continues! This tropical paradise teems with life, both alluring and deadly. Will you survive the wilderness, tame its exotic beauties, and uncover the island\u2019s darkest secrets?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Survival Harem Adventure Like No Other</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrive Against the Odds:</strong> Hunt, craft, and build while managing relationships with your growing harem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tame Wild Hearts:</strong> Seduce monster girls with unique personalities, kinks, and storylines, each requires a different approach!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962010/extras/5fea7fe5f2f9285477655c0e51f60b62.avif?t=1752506110\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breed Your Perfect Girls:</strong> Mix genes to create stunning offspring with traits you choose (yes, including those voluptuous curves!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962010/extras/89133a1535662bff255483465279d8fb.avif?t=1752506110\" width=800 height=508 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a Village Legacy:</strong> Construct homes, assign tasks, and watch your community flourish, with &quot;steamy incentives&quot; for success.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open World: Explore every inch of a vast island, from lush jungles to ancient ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962010/extras/2568f037dbcc1ee619317868feb4fe99.avif?t=1752506110\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realtime Animated Hot Scenes: Interactive, immersive scenes with dynamic angles and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962010/extras/a93b41b1846329f28cc12e2d416bb879.avif?t=1752506110\" width=800 height=473 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame Monster Girls: Convert fierce predators into loyal lovers (or submit to them \u2014 your call).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962010/extras/13d18936b1e2555b22e3ce32e3e3151d.avif?t=1752506110\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Village Sim: Craft, farm, and customize your settlement with harem-approved amenities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962010/extras/9066f2b010f2d592c6fb05f660e416f9.avif?t=1752506110\" width=800 height=422 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Story: Multiple endings shaped by your decisions, will you be a tender lover or a dominant conqueror?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Meets Strategy: Balance resource management with seduction tactics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;But where\u2019s Tonya?&quot;</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue the kidnapped pilot, solve the mystery of a lost civilization, and decide: Will this island become your paradise\u2026 or your prison?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your adventure, the island\u2019s dangers (and pleasures) await!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962010/extras/e6521ff59a18014e1c60b0b4fa5e4806.avif?t=1752506110\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame It Too! is a survival harem breeding game! Here you'll find everything you love about these genres. Every day will be a challenge, because survival is not just for show! You'll have to take care of yourself and your girlfriends, evolve, adapt to the local flora and fauna, conquer, build, learn and teach!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962010/extras/79e197d30ddeb84592b9c43543932e2b.avif?t=1752506110\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After crash-landing on a new, even more dangerous island, Lee\u2019s adventure continues! This tropical paradise teems with life, both alluring and deadly. Will you survive the wilderness, tame its exotic beauties, and uncover the island\u2019s darkest secrets?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Survival Harem Adventure Like No Other</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrive Against the Odds:</strong> Hunt, craft, and build while managing relationships with your growing harem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tame Wild Hearts:</strong> Seduce monster girls with unique personalities, kinks, and storylines, each requires a different approach!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962010/extras/5fea7fe5f2f9285477655c0e51f60b62.avif?t=1752506110\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breed Your Perfect Girls:</strong> Mix genes to create stunning offspring with traits you choose (yes, including those voluptuous curves!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962010/extras/89133a1535662bff255483465279d8fb.avif?t=1752506110\" width=800 height=508 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a Village Legacy:</strong> Construct homes, assign tasks, and watch your community flourish, with &quot;steamy incentives&quot; for success.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open World: Explore every inch of a vast island, from lush jungles to ancient ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962010/extras/2568f037dbcc1ee619317868feb4fe99.avif?t=1752506110\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realtime Animated Hot Scenes: Interactive, immersive scenes with dynamic angles and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962010/extras/a93b41b1846329f28cc12e2d416bb879.avif?t=1752506110\" width=800 height=473 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame Monster Girls: Convert fierce predators into loyal lovers (or submit to them \u2014 your call).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962010/extras/13d18936b1e2555b22e3ce32e3e3151d.avif?t=1752506110\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Village Sim: Craft, farm, and customize your settlement with harem-approved amenities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962010/extras/9066f2b010f2d592c6fb05f660e416f9.avif?t=1752506110\" width=800 height=422 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Story: Multiple endings shaped by your decisions, will you be a tender lover or a dominant conqueror?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Meets Strategy: Balance resource management with seduction tactics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;But where\u2019s Tonya?&quot;</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue the kidnapped pilot, solve the mystery of a lost civilization, and decide: Will this island become your paradise\u2026 or your prison?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your adventure, the island\u2019s dangers (and pleasures) await!</p>",
